Package: citos-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CIT-OS maintainers <citos@cybroid.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/cybroidinstitute/cit-os
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: citos-base (>= @VERSION@), citos-artwork (>= @VERSION@),
 xserver-xorg-core, xserver-xorg-input-libinput, x11-xserver-utils, xauth,
 lightdm, lightdm-gtk-greeter,
 xfce4-session, xfwm4, xfdesktop4, xfce4-panel, xfce4-settings, xfconf,
 thunar, xfce4-terminal, mousepad, xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin, xfce4-notifyd,
 xfce4-taskmanager, ristretto,
 greybird-gtk-theme, elementary-xfce-icon-theme, fonts-dejavu-core,
 dbus-x11, dbus-user-session, polkitd, at-spi2-core, xdg-user-dirs,
 firefox-esr, xrdp, xorgxrdp
Description: CIT-OS Desktop Lite: Xfce with the CIT-OS look
 A light desktop for servers and VMs: Xfce with a whisker menu, terminal,
 file manager, text editor, task manager and Firefox ESR; LightDM with the
 CIT-OS wallpaper and logo; and xrdp, so Remote Desktop clients can sign in.
 About 400 MB of memory when idle.
